 * computed with a fast bit-mask rather than a modulo. The table grows
 * automatically once the fraction of occupied slots (live entries plus
 * tombstones) exceeds the configured load factor, keeping operations amortized
 * {@code O(1)}.
 *
 * <p>The map is {@link Iterable} over its {@link Entry entries}, and also exposes
 * {@link #keys()} and {@link #values()} views; all three iterate in an unspecified
 * order and are <em>fail-fast</em> (a structural modification during iteration
